{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":1,"exerciseID":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":9,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"九年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)30°(2)20 $\\sqrt2$ ","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed76786a47b5ff8003181bb","queId":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee9"}],"question":"如图，上午9时，一条船从A处出发，以每小时40海里的速度向正东方向航行，9时30分到达B处，从A，B两处分别测得小岛C在北偏东45°和北偏东15°．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/9f5b9f36-5bd4-4ab7-a8e8-6691b9c20114image27.png\">","solution":"(1)过点B作BE⊥AC与点E．由题意得，∠ABC＝105°，∠CAB＝45°，∴∠C＝180°﹣105°﹣45°＝30°；(2)由题意得，AB＝40 $\\times\\frac12=$ 20（海里），在Rt△ABE中，BE＝AB•sin45°＝10 $\\sqrt2$ （海里），在Rt△BCE中，∠CBE＝60°，∴BC＝2BE＝20 $\\sqrt2$ （海里），答：B处船与小岛C的距离为20 $\\sqrt2$ 海里．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/9f5b9f36-5bd4-4ab7-a8e8-6691b9c20114image28.png\">","subQueNum":2,"subQues":[{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"ENyrAwQ2WrektGpLhbT","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","question":"求∠C的度数；","sortIndex":1},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"pPncYmrFZ7VGnCjtoz1","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","question":"求B处船与小岛C的距离．（结果保留根号）","sortIndex":2}],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ebb523f518ec3c65e1e865f","knowName":"方向角与方位角","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","sortIndex":582,"subQueId":"ENyrAwQ2WrektGpLhbT"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec348c6518ec3c65e1e8b47","knowName":"三角形的内角和定理","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0EY5wlLQyMx65Tf3WBg","sortIndex":637,"subQueId":"ENyrAwQ2WrektGpLhbT"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec349c8518ec3c65e1e8b50","knowName":"三角形中角的计算","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priorit